---
/**
 * Accessibility statement (D121). New — the old site had none. Every
 * "what we've done" line is true of the site as built (skip link, focus
 * outlines, reduced motion, AA text contrast from the --grn-2 change, the
 * keyboard-operable menu buttons, alt text, captions left to YouTube). It
 * says "aim", not "conform": no formal WCAG audit has been done.
 */
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage title="Accessibility" updated="Updated September 2026"
           description="East Valley Naturopathic Doctors wants everyone to be able to use this website. What we've done, what we know still falls short, and how to reach us.">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website, including people who use screen readers,
  keyboards, magnification or other assistive technology. We aim to meet the Web Content
  Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA.</p>

  <h2>What we've done</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every page can be used with a keyboard, including the menus, and starts with a
    “Skip to content” link.</li>
    <li>Links and buttons show a clear outline when they have keyboard focus.</li>
    <li>Text and link colors were chosen to meet WCAG AA contrast.</li>
    <li>Images carry text descriptions; purely decorative images are hidden from screen readers.</li>
    <li>If your device is set to reduce motion, the homepage video and animations are turned off.</li>
    <li>Pages use real headings, lists and landmarks, so they can be navigated by structure.</li>
    <li>The layout adapts to phones and to zoomed text without scrolling sideways.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we know isn't perfect yet</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Some older PDF forms and handouts were created years ago and may not work well with screen
    readers.</li>
    <li>Online booking, forms, the patient portal, maps and videos are provided by other companies,
    and we can't fully control how accessible they are.</li>
    <li>Some older articles include images that contain text.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>If anything on this site gets in your way, we'll help you another way — by phone, or with the
  information in a format that works for you.</p>

  <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
  <p>Please let us know which page and what went wrong:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></li>
    <li>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
  </ul>
</LegalPage>
